        "Content": "Mid terrace two bedroom  cottage. \r\nExtending to approximately 41 sq. m (441 sq ft). \r\nSouth facing garden rear garden. \r\nDublin 8 residential location.\r\nIdeal for an owner occupier or investment property \r\nVacant possession.\r\n\r\nThe property provides a mid-terrace two-bedroom cottage in the heart of Dublin 8, within walking distance of Dublin city centre. The property is a single-storey building beneath a pitched roof.The property is situated in the vibrant Dublin 8 area, surrounded by a wealth of social and essential amenities including a diverse selection of shops, bars, and restaurants. The location benefits from close proximity to key educational institutions such as St. Catherine's, Griffith College, and Portobello College, while also offering direct accessibility to major business districts including the IFSC, Grand Canal Dock, and St. Stephen's Green.We are informed the property extends to approximately 41sq. m (441 sq. ft).\r\n\r\nVacant possession."
